<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE FIRST TEST THIRD DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE FIRST TEST THIRD DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>third day of the first cricket test between Pakistan and</p>
<p>Zimbabwe on Saturday:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings 375 (G.Flower 110, P.Strang 106 not</p>
<p>out, Shahid Nazir 5-53).</p>
<p>Pakistan first Innings (Overnight 189-6)</p>
<p> Saeed Anwar st A.Flower b P.Strang	 51</p>
<p> Aamir Sohail c A.Flower b P.Strang	 46</p>
<p> Shadab Kabir c Houghton b A.Whittal	 2</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmad lbw b Olonga			 9</p>
<p> Salim Malik b P.Strang			 52</p>
<p> Azam Khan lbw b P.Strang		     14</p>
<p> Moin Khan c A. Whittal b P.Strang	  18</p>
<p> Wasim Akram not out			   144</p>
<p> Saqlain Mushtaq not out			37</p>
<p> Extras (b-9 lb-7 nb-4 w-2)		   22</p>
<p> Total (for seven wickets)		   395</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-64 2-77 3-91 4-142 5-176 6-183 7-237.</p>
<p>To bat: Waqar Younis, Shahid Nazir.</p>
<p>Bowling to date: Olonga 19-6-60-1 (nb1 w1), B.Strang</p>
<p>10-2-34-0 (nb1 w1), A. Whittal 34-5-98-1, P.Strang 52-10-142-5</p>
<p>(nb1), G.Whittal 11-0-35-0 (nb1), G.Flower 10-4-10-0.</p>
